              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.1+EXO.12.2+EXO.12.3+EXO.12.4+EXO.12.5+EXO.12.6+EXO.12.7+EXO.12.8+EXO.12.9+EXO.12.10+EXO.12.11+EXO.12.12+EXO.12.13+EXO.12.14+EXO.12.15+EXO.12.16+EXO.12.17+EXO.12.18+EXO.12.19+EXO.12.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yaa 12.1-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka i nino dwe apar wie aŋwen me dwe me agege, jo Icrael ame odwogo iyi opii te kwero ecuban me Kato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olamdog luŋ kede Olevi luŋ onwoŋo doŋ otyeko lonyere oko kengi, gin luŋ onwoŋo doŋ odoko jo acil, en omio gin doŋ te neko itino rommi me kwero ecuban me Kato, kun oneko pi jo luŋ, pi olamdog kede pirgi gin kengi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo Icrael luŋ ame odwogo iyi opii obedo camo cam me kwero ecuban me Kato karacel, kede ŋat acel acel ame doŋ otyeko weko tim me kwer a jo ame onwoŋo bedo i lobo-nono te notte kedgi me woro Rwot Obaŋa me Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin te bedo kwero ecuban me ogati a tobi mom iye pi nino abiro, kun otye kede yomcuny; pien Rwot onwoŋo doŋ oyomoro cunygi, dok onwoŋo daŋ omio cuny abaka me Acuria odwogo i komgi, ame omio okonyogi tics me gero ot Obaŋa, ame obedo Obaŋa a jo Icrael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
